                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/releases/tag/v3.31.0"&gt;3.31.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;Summary&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add support for .NET 10&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add support for &lt;code&gt;MongoDB.Driver&lt;/code&gt; v3.5+&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Changes&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Tracer&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use RuntimeHelpers.GetHashCode in IndexObject (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3533430912" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7678" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7678/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7678"&gt;#7678&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Removing V1 tags class from AWS integrations (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3575043398" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7746" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7746/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7746"&gt;#7746&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add support for &lt;code&gt;MongoDB.Driver&lt;/code&gt; v3.5+ (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3621120332" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7808" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7808/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7808"&gt;#7808&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compress telemetry payload (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3508962749" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7645" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7645/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7645"&gt;#7645&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Continuous Profiler&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Crashtracker] Add module path to frames (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3502743467" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7642" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7642/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7642"&gt;#7642&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Serverless&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Docs] Add Azure Functions architecture docs and PowerShell debugging tools (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3500431643" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7639" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7639/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7639"&gt;#7639&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Fixes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix null character termination in CString abstraction. (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3595038168" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7785" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7785/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7785"&gt;#7785&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add fix for persistent &lt;code&gt;Process.Start&lt;/code&gt; version-conflict issue (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3596444461" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7789" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7789/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7789"&gt;#7789&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Protect against null LoggingEvent and Properties in log4net (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3565805580" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7735" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7735/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7735"&gt;#7735&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix &lt;code&gt;InvalidOperationException&lt;/code&gt; in Baggage handling in Azure Functions (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3622068710" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7810" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7810/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7810"&gt;#7810&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
